[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3762431179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115054#issuecomment-3762431179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115054","id":3762431179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gQiTL","user":{"login":"foohines","id":4998620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTg2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4998620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines","html_url":"https://github.com/foohines","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T01:06:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T01:06:43Z","body":"I've also just noticed that using `load` instead of `preload` to load the compressed image fixes the issue as well.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3762431179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763028938","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115054#issuecomment-3763028938","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115054","id":3763028938,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gS0PK","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T10:45:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T10:45:40Z","body":"The image file isn't changed, `preload` loads a resource *once* and caches it, so you operate on the same cached instance, so I'd say this is expected and no different from doing:\n```gdscript\nvar texture: CompressedTexture2D = load('res://icon.svg')\nvar image = texture.get_image()\n\nprint(image.get_size())\n\n@warning_ignore('integer_division')\nimage.resize(image.get_width() / 2, image.get_height() / 2)\n\nimage = texture.get_image()\n\nprint(image.get_size())\n\n@warning_ignore('integer_division')\nimage.resize(image.get_width() / 2, image.get_height() / 2)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763028938/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763070257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115054#issuecomment-3763070257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115054","id":3763070257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gS-Ux","user":{"login":"foohines","id":4998620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTg2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4998620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines","html_url":"https://github.com/foohines","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T11:04:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T11:06:10Z","body":"Thanks for the reply. \n\nI get that preloading a resource caches it, and operating on the resource will affect the cached version. However, I don't think any of this code should actually operate on the preloaded resource. The [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_texture2d.html#class-texture2d-method-get-image) for `Texture2D.get_image()` states that it\n\n>Returns an [Image](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_image.html#class-image) that is a copy of data from this Texture2D (a new [Image](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_image.html#class-image) is created each time). [Image](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_image.html#class-image)s can be accessed and manipulated directly.\n\nFrom this language I infer that operating on an `Image` from `Texture2D.get_image()` should not affect the `Texture2D` since the resulting image is just a copy of the data - not the texture data itself. And operating on a copy of data shouldn't affect the original data.\n\nAm I thinking about this correctly?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763070257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763088425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115054#issuecomment-3763088425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115054","id":3763088425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gTCwp","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T11:10:19Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T11:11:41Z","body":"The documentation is probably incorrect, though I'm not sure what is proper here, it might also not affect the actual data but that the image is a cached copy of the stored data, the compressed texture class call the rendering server to fetch the image which probably has a cached copy of the data actually on the GPU","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763088425/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763105029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115054#issuecomment-3763105029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115054","id":3763105029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gTG0F","user":{"login":"foohines","id":4998620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTg2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4998620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines","html_url":"https://github.com/foohines","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T11:16:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T11:17:02Z","body":"So I tried the code you suggested. In an editor script, the resulting output is \n```\n(128, 128)\n(64, 64)\n```\n\nBut if I run the same code in the root node `_ready()`, the output is\n```\n(128, 128)\n(128, 128)\n```\n\nThis seems odd to me\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763105029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763110326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115054#issuecomment-3763110326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115054","id":3763110326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gTIG2","user":{"login":"foohines","id":4998620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTg2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4998620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines","html_url":"https://github.com/foohines","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T11:18:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T11:18:29Z","body":"I apologize, I accidentally closed the issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763110326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763153676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115054#issuecomment-3763153676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115054","id":3763153676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gTSsM","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T11:29:38Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T11:29:38Z","body":"That might be down to data being processed differently and when the data is loaded","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763153676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]